Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:49:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/40] Standardize the libretro command line: -L, -cart and
 libretropath

* -L is an alias of -libretro_core and accepts a full path, a file name or a core name, the last two searched in the new libretropath search path (a core name gets the platform _libretro suffix)
* The content is loaded from a cartridge image device (-cart/-cartridge) like for other consoles, it takes the extensions reported by the core; -libretro_content is removed
* Rename -libretro_system_path to -libretro_system_directory, following MAME naming conventions

